// Title: Python Reverse Shell Execution Via PTY And Socket Modules
// ID: 32e62bc7-3de0-4bb1-90af-532978fe42c0
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: @d4ns4n_, Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2023-04-24
// Tags: attack.execution
// Description: Detects the execution of python with calls to the socket and pty module in order to connect and spawn a potential reverse shell.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where (process.executable like "*_python*" and (process.command_line like "*_ -c *" and process.command_line like "*_import*" and process.command_line like "*_pty*" and process.command_line like "*_socket*" and process.command_line like "*_spawn*" and process.command_line like "*_.connect*"))
